OL,3,GNEWSAShire horses help plant new city
OL,4,Awildflower meadow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team of shire horses has been
OL,7,Frecruited to help turn a corner of a
OL,8,Fcity centre park into a wildflower
OL,9,Fmeadow.
OL,11,FThe transformation of a section of
OL,12,FParker's Piece in Cambridge is a
OL,13,Fcollaboration between the city council
OL,14,Fand King's College's head gardener
OL,15,FSteve Coghill.
OL,17,FHe also oversaw the creation of a
OL,18,Fwildflower meadow on part of the lawn
OL,19,Fat the University of Cambridge college
OL,20,Fin 2020.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
